my-terraform-project/
├── terraform.tf     # CLI versions and required_providers blocks
├── providers.tf     # Active provider configurations (credentials, regions)
├── backend.tf       # Remote state settings (S3, Azure Blob, Terraform Cloud)
├── main.tf          # Core infrastructure resources or module calls
├── variables.tf     # Declarations of input variables
├── outputs.tf       # Declarations of output values
├── locals.tf        # Reusable local expressions
└── terraform.tfvars # Actual values for variables (DO NOT commit secrets!)